\par\par \b \uc2 EXCHANGE --- The Score / The Business Week in 6 Stocks: \uc2 Tesla\uc2  Caught in Crossfire, \uc2 P&G\uc2  to Cut 7,000 Jobs\b0\par\par\uc2 By Francesca Fontana \par \uc2 545 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 June 2025\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B2\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 TESLA\par \par \uc2 TSLA -14%\par \par \uc2 A fierce feud between President Trump and \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  ramped up on Thursday. What had started with Musk's criticism of Trump's tax and spending megabill escalated to barbs and insults in an afternoon of back-and-forth attacks. Their relationship had been one of the most consequential in modern American politics. The president threatened to eliminate government subsidies and contracts for Musk's businesses, while Musk called Trump "ungrateful" after his support during the 2024 campaign. Musk floated the idea of starting a third political party and agreed with a tweet that Trump should be impeached. \uc2 Tesla\uc2  shares fell 14% Thursday, losing about $152.4 billion in market value, the company's biggest one-day slide on record.\par \par \uc2 PROCTER & GAMBLE\par \par \uc2 PG -1.9%\par \par \uc2 Procter & Gamble\uc2  plans to cut 7,000 jobs over the next two years. The consumer-goods giant -- whose products include Tide detergent, Pampers diapers and Bounty paper towels -- had about 108,000 total employees as of June last year. The company said the layoffs aren't for cost-cutting purposes, but part of a reorganization aimed at creating broader roles and smaller teams. In April, \uc2 P&G\uc2  reported a decline in quarterly sales. \uc2 P&G\uc2  shares fell 1.9% Thursday.\par \par \uc2 WARNER BROS. DISCOVERY\par \par \uc2 WBD\uc2  -1.5%\par \par \uc2 Warner Bros. Discovery\uc2  shareholders rejected the pay packages of Chief Executive \uc2 David Zaslav\uc2  and his leadership team. More than 59% of Warner shareholders who cast ballots voted against the 2024 compensation plans, including Zaslav's $51.9 million package. The vote is nonbinding. The stock has fallen by roughly 60% since the merger of \uc2 AT&T\uc2 's \uc2 Warner Media\uc2  and Discovery Communications in April 2022. Warner shares fell 1.5% Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 DOLLAR GENERAL\par \par \uc2 DG +16%\par \par \uc2 Bargain chains are bucking the trend of falling retail demand, thanks to an influx of higher-income customers looking for deals. Discount-store operator \uc2 Dollar General\uc2  on Tuesday raised its annual sales outlook, after better-than-expected first-quarter results. Executives for \uc2 Dollar General\uc2  and rival \uc2 Dollar Tree\uc2  said increased demand from middle- and upper-income customers boosted sales. \uc2 Dollar General\uc2  shares soared 16% Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 CLEVELAND-CLIFFS\par \par \uc2 CLF +23%\par \par \uc2 Shares of U.S. steelmakers rallied on a move by President Trump to double steel and aluminum tariffs to 50%. Trump unveiled the higher duties at a rally on May 30 promoting a $14 billion deal between Japan's \uc2 Nippon Steel\uc2  and \uc2 U.S. Steel\uc2 . Trump said that the move to increase the levies, which took effect June 4, would protect U.S. jobs. Higher tariffs will also give domestic steelmakers more pricing power. \uc2 Cleveland-Cliffs\uc2  shares surged 23% Monday, while \uc2 Steel Dynamics\uc2  and \uc2 Nucor\uc2  shares each gained 10%.\par \par \uc2 LULULEMON ATHLETICA\par \par \uc2 LULU -20%\par \par \uc2 Proposed tariffs are threatening \uc2 Lululemon\uc2 's supply chain, leading the sportswear brand to cut its annual profit outlook Thursday. The company still expects sales of $11.15 billion to $11.3 billion. \uc2 Lululemon\uc2  expects proposed U.S. levies to raise costs, and the company is planning price increases. The tariffs affect products from some of the company's largest sourcing bases, including Vietnam, Cambodia and Sri Lanka. \uc2 Lululemon\uc2  shares plummeted 20% Friday.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020250607el670003k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
